"Thornmouth has three descending chambers of thorn-grown rock ending at a heart chamber."
"In the heart chamber a thorn mother, about level two hundred and forty, buds new thornlings."
"Maren was shut outside the second chamber when its walls closed, and cut through too late."
"The thorn mother wraps the dungeon's core, a fist-sized red crystal, in her roots."
"Thornmouth is waking: a fourth chamber is opening below the heart, which is why spawn has doubled."
"The rangers who died were caught in the second chamber when its thorn walls closed behind them."
"The dead rangers' gear lies in the second chamber, including a good steel sword and a bow."
